# Freehold Shoal (CIPlay freehold_shoal), STORY 10-24: the landing, the founding board with Maud's chalk, Pip's tram line
# note, three plank bundles, the well crank (shows the first night's note), a hen for the coop, the squatter's slate, the
# dive to the drowned squatters' cash tin, the dune, Rook's van crate (Pip's tin tram), the tramway crank, Lookout Hill
# and Ines's spyglass, the first night.
# offset 0 0 is a placeholder: phase 2 sets it from the recipe's save log (PLAY_FORMAT: Coordinates).
island Freehold Shoal
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Freehold
expect hidden firstnight
zone landing
expect step 1
read Freehold founding
expect step 2
read Pip's tram line
expect step 3
openat 2.7 -25.9
openat 16.7 -17.9
openat 26.7 -41.9
expect story plankbundle 3
expect step 4
use wellcrank
expect shown firstnight
expect step 5
catch Chicken 1
expect step 6
read Old squatter's slate
expect step 7
# (the tramway crank refuses without the tin tram)
use tramcrank
expect story tramrun 0
zone fh_deep
expect step 8
expect stand -69 0 h=-12
open Squatters' hut strongbox
wait 3
expect story fh_deep 1
expect step 9
zone dune_top
expect step 10
open Rook's van crate
wait 3
expect story tintram 1
expect step 11
use tramcrank
expect story tramrun 1
expect step 12
# (the ledge cache wants a keycard)
zone fh_summit
expect step 13
expect stand -21.76 -49.76 h=26
open Freehold lookout deck box
wait 3
expect story fh_top 1
expect step 14
read Freehold's first night
expect done
